{"id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-set-theoretic-background.md","title":"Set-Theoretic Background","display":"Set-Theoretic Background","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","aliases":["93-df-set-theoretic-background"],"display":"Set-Theoretic Background","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-set-theoretic-background"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-set-theoretic-background</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Set-Theoretic Background"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-set-theoretic-background---Set-Theoretic-Background\">df-set-theoretic-background - Set-Theoretic Background</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is the ambient universe of sets and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is its standard set of natural numbers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,f\\in V\\)</span>; a natural number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> is identified with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_{93},\\mathrm{Func}_{93},\\mathrm{Bij}_{93},\\mathrm{Finite}_{93},\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_{93},\\mathrm{Func}_{93},\\mathrm{Bij}_{93},\\mathrm{Finite}_{93},\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}\\)</span> are the local predicates defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>背景为带选择公理的集合—类理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MK}+\\mathsf{AC}\">\\(\\mathsf{MK}+\\mathsf{AC}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是所有集合的类。类参数不作为集合元素；有限序列与元组均带有确定长度，坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始，结构投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 开始。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> 对集合图使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}\\)</span>，对类图使用下方 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}\\)</span>；两者在集合参数上等价。仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 是集合时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X\\to Y)\">\\((X\\to Y)\\)</span> 才表示函数集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V\\)</span> 可为类函数，不能将这种类函数再作为集合元素。函数取值与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在其唯一值存在的定义域上使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:m\\to X\">\\(a:m\\to X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:n\\to X\">\\(b:n\\to X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a{}^\\frown b\">\\(a{}^\\frown b\\)</span> 的定义域为这样的有限序列对。数值计算采用通常的自然数、整数、有理数和实数结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 的谓词及类记号在下文同时给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E,G\">\\(D,E,G\\)</span> 可为类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}\\)</span> 的量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 仍只遍历集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(X)\\)</span> 只对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1})\">\\(f(a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1})\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq2\">\\(n\\geq2\\)</span> 时是元组自变量求值的下列语法缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 可为类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^I\">\\(D^I\\)</span> 表示下方定义的集合指标族类，其成员是集合图，不把定义在真类上的类函数作为集合元素。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists!y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists!y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,n,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,n,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,\\omega)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,\\omega)\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x&#39;)\\to x=x&#39;)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(G,D,E)\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq D\\times E\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists!y\\in E\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(G,D,E)\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq D\\times E\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists!y\\in E\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(G:D\\to E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(G,D,E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(G:D\\to E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(G,D,E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f,X,Y\\in V\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f,X,Y\\in V\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\}\n\\quad(X,Y\\in V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\}\n\\quad(X,Y\\in V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D^I\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(f,I,D)\\}\n\\quad(I\\in V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D^I\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(f,I,D)\\}\n\\quad(I\\in V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(n\\to X),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{id}_X\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Seq}(X)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(n\\to X),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{id}_X\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a{}^\\frown b\\coloneqq a\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(a)+j,b(j)\\rangle:j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(b)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a{}^\\frown b\\coloneqq a\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(a)+j,b(j)\\rangle:j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(b)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i(\\langle a_1,\\ldots,a_n\\rangle)\\coloneqq a_i\n\\quad(1\\leq i\\leq n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_i(\\langle a_1,\\ldots,a_n\\rangle)\\coloneqq a_i\n\\quad(1\\leq i\\leq n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ord}(a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;a\\in V\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;(x\\subseteq a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\land y\\in z\\to x\\in z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B\\subseteq a\\;(B\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists m\\in B\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\\neg(b\\in m)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ord}(a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;a\\in V\n\\land\\forall x\\in a\\;(x\\subseteq a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in a\\;(x\\in y\\land y\\in z\\to x\\in z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B\\subseteq a\\;(B\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists m\\in B\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\\neg(b\\in m)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\\coloneqq\\{a:\\mathrm{Ord}(a)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ord}\\coloneqq\\{a:\\mathrm{Ord}(a)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1})\\coloneqq\nf(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle)\n\\quad\\bigl(n\\in\\omega,\\ n\\geq2,\\ \\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1})\\coloneqq\nf(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle)\n\\quad\\bigl(n\\in\\omega,\\ n\\geq2,\\ \\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The assertions are separated so that an object-valued definition is never joined to another definition by propositional conjunction. Function application is used only after <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}\\)</span> supplies a unique graph value.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-set-theoretic-background---Set-Theoretic-Background","text":"df-set-theoretic-background - Set-Theoretic Background","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_{93},\\mathrm{Func}_{93},\\mathrm{Bij}_{93},\\mathrm{Finite}_{93},\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{MK}+\\mathsf{AC}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"(X\\to Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f:\\mathcal K\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a:m\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"b:n\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"a{}^\\frown b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"D,E,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"f(a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Set}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in V","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists!y\\in Y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x')\\to x=x')\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(f(x)=y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Bij}_{93}(f,n,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}theoretic\\text{-}background}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Countable}_{93}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Func}_{93}(f,X,\\omega)\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;(f(x)=f(x')\\to x=x')\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassFunc}_{93}(G,D,E)\\leftrightarrow\nG\\subseteq D\\times E\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\